namespace WTVRSettingsAssistant;

internal static class ReleaseNotes
{
    public const string Features = "• Separate Monitor and VR graphics/control profiles, saved locally for portable use.\n• Graphics presets and guidance for configuring a VR setup.\n• Live/Test server selection, installed-version display and launcher-based game updating.\n• Neck Assistant with Simple/Advanced modes, configurable bindings and head-rotation curves.\n• SteamVR OpenXR and VDXR support for Neck Assistant.\n• KeyBind Assistant maps keyboard, mouse and HOTAS inputs to game shortcuts.\n• Physical ON/OFF and multi-position switch mappings, virtual-button output and custom action sequences.\n• Integrated VTrim with physical-axis assignment, inversion, calibration and vJoy output.\n• Separate pitch, roll and rudder trim bindings, reset, Store Trim and adjustable repeat behavior.\n• Live stick/rudder previews and configurable axis response curves.\n• Editable curve points with Copy/Paste/Reset and synchronized sliders.\n• Default controls and aircraft-specific Custom Profiles with saved bindings, trim and curves.\n• Aircraft search, cached artwork and automatic profile selection from local telemetry.\n• Full-page profile editing and profile copy/paste tools.\n• F-16 and MiG-29 themes, improved asset edges and responsive layouts.\n• Multilingual interface, tray options, Windows startup and single-instance handling.\n• App updating that preserves existing settings and profiles.\n• Flight Assistant interface included; flight-control assistance remains locked pending Gaijin clarification.";
}
